flowchart TD
    OP[Operator or consumer installer] --> CLI[Public bootstrap full-runtime]
    CLI --> LOCK[Infrastructure lifecycle lock]
    LOCK --> INIT[Owner preparation with supplied credentials]
    INIT --> MODEL[Canonical manifest and Compose model]
    MODEL --> GUARD[Installation owner, configuration, image and replicas]
    MODEL --> SPIRE[Public SPIRE export and exact receipt]
    SPIRE --> NATIVE[Existing owner coordinator, no root recreation]
    GUARD --> PREP[Owner provisioning and migration barriers]
    PREP --> START[Start without container recreation]
    START --> FRESH[New installation: native SPIRE bootstrap from private inputs]
    START --> LOCAL[Optional local owner input configuration]
    LOCAL --> GRAFANA[Public Grafana operator issues separate scoped tokens]
    GRAFANA --> MATERIAL[SPIRE prepares own PKI with separately issued client identities]
    MATERIAL --> FRESH
    FRESH --> SPIRE
    START --> HEALTH[All declared runtime health contracts]
    NATIVE --> HEALTH
    HEALTH --> TEMP{Auto-created temporary Grafana authority?}
    TEMP -->|yes| REVOKE[Retire exact provisioner through public operator]
    REVOKE --> RESULT[RUNTIME_HEALTHY]
    TEMP -->|no| RESULT
    GUARD --> HANDOFF[Drift requires owner handoff]
    RESULT -.-> ADMISSION[Separate quality and site admission]
